---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Bâti-Axe — Construction Marketplace Case Study"
  description="Architecture and technical details of Bâti-Axe, a double-sided construction marketplace."
>
  <header class="header" role="banner">
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main Navigation">
      <a href="/#work" class="logo" aria-label="Back to home">&larr; Back</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="case-study-main">
    <article class="case-study-content">
      <header class="cs-header">
        <div class="badge">Marketplace & IaC</div>
        <h1>Bâti-Axe</h1>
        <p class="cs-lead">A highly-regulated, double-sided marketplace bridging the gap between homeowners needing verified construction professionals and artisans seeking leads.</p>
        
        <div class="cs-meta">
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span class="meta-label">Role</span>
            <span class="meta-value">Lead Architect</span>
          </div>
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span class="meta-label">Stack</span>
            <span class="meta-value">Nuxt 4, Vue 3, Terraform, Stripe</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="cs-body">
        <h2>Infrastructure as Code (IaC)</h2>
        <p>Bâti-Axe goes beyond typical frontend development. The entire infrastructure—from Cloudflare DNS and Pages deployments to the Supabase PostgreSQL database—is defined immutably using <strong>Terraform</strong>. This guarantees a strictly reproducible environment where staging and production are mathematically identical.</p>

        <div class="cs-code-block">
          <div class="code-header">
            <span class="dot-red"></span><span class="dot-yellow"></span><span class="dot-green"></span>
            <span class="code-title">terraform/main.tf</span>
          </div>
          <div class="code-body">
            <span class="kw">module</span> <span class="str">"cloudflare_pages"</span> {'{'}
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="kw">source</span> = <span class="str">"./modules/cloudflare"</span>
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;project_name = <span class="str">"bati-axe-app"</span>
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;environment  = <span class="kw">var</span>.env
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;domain       = <span class="str">"bati-axe.fr"</span>
            <br>{'}'}
            <br>
            <br><span class="kw">module</span> <span class="str">"supabase"</span> {'{'}
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="kw">source</span> = <span class="str">"./modules/database"</span>
            <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;enable_rls = <span class="num">true</span>
            <br>{'}'}
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Monetization & Stripe Integration</h2>
        <p>The business model relies on a freemium system for homeowners and a subscription/lead-buying model for professionals. I integrated a secure Stripe pipeline leveraging Supabase Edge Functions as webhooks. This architecture securely processes payments, manages recurring subscriptions, and automatically provisions or revokes access to premium leads in the database without relying on a traditional heavy Node.js backend.</p>

        <ul class="cs-list">
          <li><strong>Magic-Link Auth:</strong> Passwordless login via Resend to reduce friction for less tech-savvy professionals.</li>
          <li><strong>Storage Optimization:</strong> Direct-to-R2 uploads for massive portfolio images and legal documents to bypass Supabase storage limits and drastically reduce bandwidth costs.</li>
          <li><strong>Server-side Nuxt:</strong> Leverage Nuxt 4 server API routes for secure operations.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="demo">Live Environments & Access</h2>
        <p>You can access the production environment directly below. Some features may require an account to view, but the main landing and professional directory are public.</p>

        <div class="demo-grid">
          <div class="demo-card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
            <h3>Bâti-Axe Production</h3>
            <p>The live production marketplace.</p>
            <div class="demo-creds">
              <span class="cred-label">URL:</span> <a href="https://bati-axe-production.pages.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">bati-axe-production.pages.dev</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .header {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.8);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .logo {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .logo:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .case-study-main {
    padding: 8rem 1.25rem 5rem;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .case-study-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .case-study-content {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .cs-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .cs-lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .cs-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .meta-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .meta-value {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .cs-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .cs-body p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .cs-list {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .cs-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .cs-list strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .cs-code-block {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
  .code-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .code-title {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  .dot-red { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF5F57; }
  .dot-yellow { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFBD2E; }
  .dot-green { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #28C840; }
  .code-body {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .kw { color: #cba6f7; }
  .fn { color: #89b4fa; }
  .str { color: #a6e3a1; }
  .num { color: #fab387; }

  .demo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .demo-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  .demo-card {
    background: var(--bg-base);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  .demo-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .demo-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .demo-creds {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .cred-label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: inline-block;
    width: 45px;
  }
  .demo-creds a {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .demo-creds a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>
